<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Bright College Years (Henry Durand)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1881</span><span class="sg-chain-h">same melody (alma mater of Yale University)</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Doshisha College Song</span><span class="sg-chain-h">same melody</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">La vedetta delle Alpi (Giovanni Pascoli)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">same melody, new words (&quot;Twin anthem of the 'Wacht am Rhein'&quot;)</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">When We've Wound Up the Watch on the Rhine</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1914</span><span class="sg-chain-h">parody</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Mademoiselle Fifi (César Cui)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1902–1903</span><span class="sg-chain-h">quoted in</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">All Quiet on the Western Front (Lewis Milestone)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1930</span><span class="sg-chain-h">used in film</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">La Grande Illusion (Jean Renoir)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1937</span><span class="sg-chain-h">used in film</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Casablanca</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1942</span><span class="sg-chain-h">used in film</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Watch on the Rhine (Lillian Hellman)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1941</span><span class="sg-chain-h">title</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Berlin Alexanderplatz (Fassbinder)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1980</span><span class="sg-chain-h">used in film</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Iron Sky</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2012</span><span class="sg-chain-h">same melody, new words (parody)</span></li></ul></section>
<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired-by"><h2>What it drew on</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Der Deutsche Rhein (Nikolaus Becker)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1840</span><span class="sg-chain-h">inspired by</span></li></ul></section>
